{title: 277 - For Your Holy Book We Thank You}
{subtitle: SDA Hymnal #277 • }
{lyricist: }
{composer: }
{key: C}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: Moderato}
{meta: hymn_number 277}
{meta: category Holy Scriptures - }

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[C]For Your [F/C]holy [C]book we [G7/B]thank You,
[F/A]And [G7/B]for [C]all [Am]who [G/D]served [Dm]You [G]well,
[C]Writing, [A/C#]guarding, [D7]and translating,
[Em]That [B/F#]its [Em/G]pages might [B]forth [Em]tell
[Dm]Your [G7/D]strong [C]love and [Am]tender [Dm]care
[G/B]For Your [G7]people [F]everywhere.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[C]For Your [F/C]holy [C]book we [G7/B]thank You,
[F/A]And [G7/B]for [C]those [Am]who [G/D]work [Dm]today,
[C]That the [A/C#]people [D7]of all [B/D#]nations,
[Em]Reading [B/F#]it [Em/G]and [Am]following [Em]may
[Dm]Know [G7/D]Your [C]love and [Am]tender [Dm]care
[G/B]For Your [G7]people [F]everywhere.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
[C]For Your [F/C]holy [C]book we [G7/B]thank You,
[F/A]May [G7/B]its [C]message [G/D]be [Dm]our [G]guide,
[C]May we [A/C#]understand [D7]the [B/D#]wisdom
[Em]Of [B/F#]the [Em/G]laws [Am]it [Em/B]will [B]provide:
[Dm]And [G7/D]Your [C]love and [Am]tender [Dm]care
[G/B]For Your [G7]people [F]everywhere.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 4}
[C]For Your [F/C]holy [C]book we [G7/B]thank You,
[F/A]May [G7/B]its [C]message [G/D]in [Dm]our [G]hearts
[C]Lead us [A/C#]now to [D7]see in [B/D#]Jesus
[Em]All [B/F#]the [Em/G]grace [Am]Your [Em/B]word [B]imparts:
[Dm]All [G7/D]Your [C]love and [Am]tender [Dm]care
[G/B]For Your [G7]people [F]everywhere.
{end_of_verse}
